- Oh, I see.

00:34:19.560 --> 00:34:21.560
- The weather's nice today.
- Yes, love.

00:35:07.320 --> 00:35:08.760
You're gorgeous!

00:35:08.800 --> 00:35:11.640
You're the most beautiful of all!

00:35:16.000 --> 00:35:18.080
Go back where you came from
right now, Kae.

00:35:19.280 --> 00:35:20.720
Girls, I've got to talk to you.

00:35:22.760 --> 00:35:24.920
But we have nothing
to talk about with you.

00:35:28.160 --> 00:35:29.390
