and power than Wichai.

00:35:32.920 --> 00:35:33.920
That's garbage.

00:35:34.200 --> 00:35:35.400
Are you pulling my leg or what?

00:35:35.640 --> 00:35:36.800
I'm serious.

00:35:37.840 --> 00:35:38.800
