00:37:58.400 --> 00:38:00.080
- Go, go, go!
- Sure!

00:38:01.960 --> 00:38:03.160
Shit! Kae!

00:38:03.200 --> 00:38:04.720
Why were you so quiet?
You scared me!

00:38:04.960 --> 00:38:07.120
Hey, Deedee's offering loans

00:38:07.520 --> 00:38:09.040
at a 20 percent interest rate.

00:38:09.080 --> 00:38:10.080
Are you interested?

00:38:10.230 --> 00:38:11.320
20 percent?

00:38:11.360 --> 00:38:12.720
Gosh, that's too much.

00:38:12.900 --> 00:38:13.800
That's a no for me.

00:38:14.080 --> 00:38:15.200
I'm here to talk business.

00:38:15.760 --> 00:38:16.760
Enough of this.

00:38:16.960 --> 00:38:18.840
I'm done splitting cuts with people.

00:38:18.960 --> 00:38:20.880
I'm not here to ask for a cut.

00:38:21.400 --> 00:38:23.600
I'm here to ask you
to be my business partner.

00:38:23.640 --> 00:38:24.920
Sister.

00:38:24.960 --> 00:38:26.280
Want to get a loan?

00:38:26.320 --> 00:38:28.000
Why do I need that much money here?

00:38:28.640 --> 00:38:30.280
I'm loaning money.

00:38:30.760 --> 00:38:32.120
Once the inmates have money,

00:38:32.280 --> 00:38:33.680
they'll order stuff from you.

00:38:34.320 --> 00:38:35.960
In return, this gives you more clients.

00:38:36.280 --> 00:38:38.440
What about you? Are you interested?

00:38:38.760 --> 00:38:40.280
No, I don't want to be in debt.

00:38:40.760 --> 00:38:42.160
What do I have to do?

00:38:42.560 --> 00:38:44.760
Sell your entire stock

00:38:45.320 --> 00:38:46.430
to me.

00:38:47.840 --> 00:38:50.160
No inmates want to take a loan.

00:38:50.600 --> 00:38:52.360
Do you know the concept
of demand and supply?

00:38:57.120 --> 00:38:59.720
We stayed quiet 'cause we don't know.

00:38:59.760 --> 00:39:01.280
Damn, just explain it!

00:39:01.960 --> 00:39:03.000
Let me illustrate.

00:39:03.240 --> 00:39:05.480
It's simple.
Demand is a desire to purchase.

00:39:05.520 --> 00:39:07.600
Supply is the goods we have.

00:39:07.640 --> 00:39:11.760
We have to make them want our supplies

00:39:11.800 --> 00:39:13.720
so much that they'll take out loans

00:39:13.760 --> 00:39:15.760
to buy what they want.

00:39:18.800 --> 00:39:21.200
If people really want our supplies,

00:39:21.460 --> 00:39:23.280
we can charge whatever we want.

00:39:23.320 --> 00:39:24.600
Stand in line, please!

00:39:25.160 --> 00:39:28.280
Now, we can just sit back
and earn our profit.

00:39:28.720 --> 00:39:31.680
It's basically killing two birds
with one stone.

00:39:32.000 --> 00:39:33.880
- Give me one!
- I'll take two.

00:39:40.920 --> 00:39:42.080
20 percent, okay?

00:39:44.400 --> 00:39:45.400
All done.

00:39:54.040 --> 00:39:55.560
Whose is this?

00:39:57.280 --> 00:39:58.600
I got it for you.

00:39:58.920 --> 00:40:00.800
You didn't have any the other day.

00:40:01.100 --> 00:40:02.000
Whoa.

00:40:02.240 --> 00:40:03.400
I'm actually craving this.

00:40:04.020 --> 00:40:05.020
Thank you.

00:40:29.480 --> 00:40:30.640
What's gotten into you?

00:40:45.560 --> 00:40:46.920
I've got good news.

00:40:48.720 --> 00:40:49.960
I...

00:40:50.640 --> 00:40:52.200
I've cleared things up
with Deedee for you.

00:40:52.960 --> 00:40:53.960
From now on,

00:40:54.440 --> 00:40:56.200
they won't be messing
with you ever again.

00:40:57.560 --> 00:40:58.560
How did you do that?

00:41:00.880 --> 00:41:02.160
With my brainpower.

00:41:02.520 --> 00:41:04.760
Everybody has desires.

00:41:05.740 --> 00:41:07.800
I just fulfill them

00:41:08.320 --> 00:41:09.960
to get what I want in return.

00:41:11.880 --> 00:41:12.880
It's a win-win.

00:41:13.160 --> 00:41:15.000
So, what does

00:41:15.040 --> 00:41:16.000
she want?

00:41:16.820 --> 00:41:18.040
Never mind.

00:41:18.480 --> 00:41:19.720
You don't need to know everything.

00:41:20.760 --> 00:41:22.480
Is it good that she stopped
messing with you?

00:41:32.840 --> 00:41:33.840
Pa'Porn.

00:41:34.240 --> 00:41:35.400
Please return to your cell.

00:41:35.440 --> 00:41:36.440
It's getting late already.

00:41:39.140 --> 00:41:39.960
Sure.

00:42:52.760 --> 00:42:53.760
Let me guess...

00:42:54.560 --> 00:42:55.560
The shoes are sold out?

00:42:57.400 --> 00:42:58.240
Are you kidding me?

00:42:58.280 --> 00:42:59.240
We've got a whole lot of them here.

00:42:59.280 --> 00:43:00.160
Are you blind or what?

00:43:00.720 --> 00:43:02.720
Yours is size 38, right?

00:43:07.200 --> 00:43:08.200
How much?

00:43:08.360 --> 00:43:09.600
Don't worry.

00:43:09.640 --> 00:43:10.880
Just have to pay us back later.

00:43:12.640 --> 00:43:14.040
Oh, thank you.

00:43:21.040 --> 00:43:21.960
Bye!

00:43:26.200 --> 00:43:28.000
Am I now sharing the room with you?

00:43:30.840 --> 00:43:32.480
I'm sorry for entering
without telling you.

00:43:33.880 --> 00:43:36.280
I just need a place to be alone.

00:43:38.160 --> 00:43:39.160
Are you telling me to leave?

00:43:39.540 --> 00:43:40.760
No, I'm not.

00:43:41.240 --> 00:43:42.240
Come and join me.

00:43:43.260 --> 00:43:44.680
Thanks for letting me in.

00:43:47.600 --> 00:43:48.760
New shoes?

00:43:56.200 --> 00:43:57.600
I lost the old pair.

00:43:59.560 --> 00:44:00.680
That's why I had to get a new pair.

00:44:14.440 --> 00:44:15.240
Here.

00:44:17.000 --> 00:44:18.400
Write your name on them.

00:44:18.900 --> 00:44:20.360
So, you can find out
who took them later.

00:44:40.600 --> 00:44:41.960
I'd better put your name on these,

00:44:43.440 --> 00:44:44.920
so nobody dares to steal them.

00:44:47.520 --> 00:44:48.600
Suit yourself.

00:44:53.120 --> 00:44:54.120
And...

00:44:54.600 --> 00:44:55.660
What mood are you in,

00:44:57.280 --> 00:44:58.800
sitting here all by yourself?

00:45:01.160 --> 00:45:02.160
Exhausted? I guess?

00:45:03.360 --> 00:45:05.080
I feel like I'm fighting by myself.

00:45:08.080 --> 00:45:09.080
Fighting against what?

00:45:10.560 --> 00:45:11.800
At first...

00:45:12.440 --> 00:45:14.480
I was fighting for my freedom.

00:45:15.560 --> 00:45:16.560
Now...

00:45:18.120 --> 00:45:20.120
It's like I'm just fighting
to survive here.

00:45:23.980 --> 00:45:25.680
You're not fighting alone, you know?

00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:32.000
Everyone's fighting for the same thing.

00:45:34.840 --> 00:45:35.960
To survive...

00:45:37.640 --> 00:45:38.720
and get out of here.

00:45:44.200 --> 00:45:45.200
What about you?

00:45:46.640 --> 00:45:47.840
What are you fighting for?

00:45:50.320 --> 00:45:51.840
I'm not fighting for anything.

00:45:54.120 --> 00:45:55.920
I chose to stay here.

00:45:57.620 --> 00:45:59.200
Life out there...

00:46:01.160 --> 00:46:04.000
There's not much for me to hope for.

00:46:06.360 --> 00:46:07.640
Perhaps,

00:46:09.560 --> 00:46:11.440
I'm much happier living here.

00:46:25.600 --> 00:46:26.880
Can I ask you something?

00:46:29.800 --> 00:46:31.440
Why do you always help me?

00:46:36.400 --> 00:46:38.920
I just hate seeing
someone get threatened.

00:46:40.380 --> 00:46:41.380
That's all.

00:46:44.780 --> 00:46:45.880
Or is it because you like me?

00:46:48.520 --> 00:46:49.720
What kind of nonsense was that?

00:46:50.120 --> 00:46:51.340
You want a piece of this?

00:46:52.800 --> 00:46:54.120
Stop trying to scare me.

00:46:54.960 --> 00:46:56.240
If you were going to hurt me,

00:46:56.280 --> 00:46:57.320
you would've done it long ago.

00:47:04.880 --> 00:47:05.760
Fine.

00:47:06.120 --> 00:47:07.240
You don't have to answer me.

00:47:22.680 --> 00:47:24.360
You remind me of myself

00:47:24.780 --> 00:47:26.640
when I first got here.

00:47:29.240 --> 00:47:30.240
How so?

00:47:33.480 --> 00:47:35.240
I felt lost

00:47:37.000 --> 00:47:38.240
in the dark.

00:47:40.420 --> 00:47:41.420
I know

00:47:43.060 --> 00:47:44.760
how bad you must've felt,

00:47:48.000 --> 00:47:49.400
the overwhelming feeling,

00:47:51.040 --> 00:47:52.840
and doubts, asking yourself,

00:47:54.760 --> 00:47:56.200
"Why does it have to be me

00:47:57.240 --> 00:47:58.520
who ends up here,

00:48:01.200 --> 00:48:02.800
even though I did nothing wrong?

00:48:10.080 --> 00:48:11.240
Why

00:48:14.160 --> 00:48:15.800
do they have to leave me all alone?"

00:48:36.960 --> 00:48:38.840
That makes me realize

00:48:42.080 --> 00:48:45.280
how important it is

00:48:47.800 --> 00:48:49.200
to have someone by our side.

00:49:00.700 --> 00:49:02.320
So, back to my first question.

00:49:05.880 --> 00:49:07.000
Do you like me?

00:50:34.200 --> 00:50:35.200
How are things?

00:50:35.240 --> 00:50:36.240
Feeling better?

00:50:37.080 --> 00:50:38.680
Mm. I'm much better now.

00:50:39.440 --> 00:50:40.440
Have a good rest, then.

00:50:46.160 --> 00:50:48.280
Inmate Bell. Step outside.

00:50:51.760 --> 00:50:52.480
Yes?

00:50:55.480 --> 00:50:56.800
[Claire]

00:50:58.720 --> 00:50:59.720
A visitor is coming to see you.

00:51:02.280 --> 00:51:03.280
Right now?

00:51:04.540 --> 00:51:05.680
Just move already.

00:51:17.320 --> 00:51:18.520
I'll wait outside, okay?

00:51:36.520 --> 00:51:37.640
Oh, Pa?

00:51:37.680 --> 00:51:38.680
Hitting the hay already?

00:51:38.880 --> 00:51:40.200
You haven't taken your meds yet.

00:51:50.800 --> 00:51:52.760
Where did you put your meds?

00:51:58.960 --> 00:51:59.960
Have a seat. Bell.

00:52:07.400 --> 00:52:08.400
I'm sorry.

00:52:10.120 --> 00:52:11.440
I'm truly sorry, Bell.

00:52:12.880 --> 00:52:14.760
I had no choice.

00:52:16.000 --> 00:52:19.040
My dad forced me to say those words.

00:52:19.880 --> 00:52:21.000
It's fine, Top.

00:52:22.720 --> 00:52:23.720
I'm down to break up.

00:52:25.120 --> 00:52:26.480
If you're not helping me,

00:52:27.680 --> 00:52:29.080
then I'll find a way out myself.

00:52:29.520 --> 00:52:30.920
Bell, I'm really sorry.

00:52:31.440 --> 00:52:32.760
I didn't mean to do that.

00:52:32.800 --> 00:52:33.920
I've never wanted to break up with you...

00:52:33.960 --> 00:52:35.040
- My dad...
- Stop talking.

00:52:40.500 --> 00:52:41.800
I just want to know

00:52:43.560 --> 00:52:44.960
why you stopped hiring Nurse Auay.

00:52:48.280 --> 00:52:49.160
Pa.

00:52:51.240 --> 00:52:52.120
Pa.

00:52:54.800 --> 00:52:55.680
Pa...

00:52:58.880 --> 00:52:59.800
Pa...

00:53:02.820 --> 00:53:04.200
Pa'Porn!

00:53:06.080 --> 00:53:08.480
Wake up, beautiful!

00:53:14.600 --> 00:53:15.840
The reason I'm here is

00:53:16.760 --> 00:53:18.520
to tell you this.

00:53:21.240 --> 00:53:23.560
Stay calm, okay?

00:53:30.320 --> 00:53:31.320
So...

00:53:35.360 --> 00:53:36.760
Your dad has passed away.

00:53:57.240 --> 00:53:58.240
Pa...

00:53:58.520 --> 00:53:59.440
Pa!

00:53:59.680 --> 00:54:00.800
Guards!

00:54:01.240 --> 00:54:02.480
Guards!

00:54:03.120 --> 00:54:04.840
Help Pa, please!

00:54:07.280 --> 00:54:08.280
Pa'Porn.

00:54:10.440 --> 00:54:11.440
Pa'Porn...

